OL,3,GNEWSAFormer lorry driver, 91, knits 200
OL,4,Awoolly hats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 91-year-old man has proven it is
OL,7,Fnever too late to learn a new skill
OL,8,Fafter taking up knitting and making
OL,9,Faround 200 hats, including for babies
OL,10,Fin hospital.
OL,12,FStanley Workman, from Woodbridge in
OL,13,FSuffolk, took up the craft five years
OL,14,Fago when his late wife, Jennifer, was
OL,15,Fgifted knitting looms but showed little
OL,16,Finterest in them.
OL,18,FWhat started out as a humble hobby to
OL,19,Fpass the time turned into a passion
OL,20,Fproject, with the former lorry driver
OL,21,Fhanding them out free of charge.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
