OL,3,GNEWSAFormer lorry driver, 91, knits 200
OL,4,Awoolly hats
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany of his head-warming creations have
OL,7,Fbeen donated to the St Mary's Shop,
OL,8,Fwhich sells products to raise money for
OL,9,FSt Mary's church in the town.
